  "known_limitations": [
    "labeled-pair attacker is an upper bound (oracle serving); real self-labeled traffic yields noisier pairs",
    "rotation cadence is per-epoch; sub-epoch accumulation is the binding constraint, so epoch sizes must stay below max_safe_epoch with margin",
    "E-R3 jitter models pad-insertion + slot permutation only; a stronger attacker with approximate alignment search is not covered",
    "E-R5 sharding WITHOUT staggering strictly weakens per-block budgets (negative control) \u2014 shard counts must not be deployed without the staggered schedule",
